// Per-symbol suite: security::allowlist
//
// This test verifies that every `extern` used by kioto is covered by the
// security allowlist. The allowlist lives in the compiler configuration and
// is validated during `mire test` with `--runtime strict` or similar.
//
// The test enumerates all known externs in the kioto package and asserts
// they are in the allowlist. If any are missing, the test fails and the
// missing names are logged.
//
// This is H1 from the plan: the allowlist is incomplete and must be
// regenerated from code rather than maintained by hand.

load kioto
load! /tests/_support/harness

// This is a manifest of all externs used by kioto modules, extracted from
// the source. The allowlist must cover all of these.
fn known_externs: () :vec[str] {
